{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "candidates",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 145,
      "width": 1380,
      "height": 145,
      "text": "## 同一完整实体 ID · 来自多个来源的字段候选\n\n例如：官方中文 levelStats、WFCD 英文 description、Plus 语言键\n每个候选都带 file / hash / pointer / locale；原件不修改",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "object",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 结构：先理解再合并\n\nnested.mjs\n对象 → 子字段递归\n有身份数组 → 按完整 ID\n匿名数组 → 整组择优",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "language",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 565,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 语言：三种输入分别处理\n\nfull-inputs / text-localization\n官方语言目录：同 ID 的文本\nPlus / Oracle：完整语言键查字典\nWFCD i18n：ID → 本地化对象",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rank",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 取值：可验证的规则\n\nfull-build.mjs · resolve\n字段优先级 ＞ 全局优先级\n有效人工修订：值 + 原因 + hash\nhash 过期 → 中止，不套旧修订",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "resolved",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 755,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 145,
      "text": "## 保存结果 + 所有候选的依据\n\nitems/*.json 与 localizations/{locale}.json\nreports/provenance.json 记录采用 / 冲突 / 修订",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "missing",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## 缺失和回退仍可辨认\n\n缺名 / 缺引用 / 缺概率分别记录\n请求语言 → 英文 → 其他已构建语言\nfallback / partial 显示实际语言",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "display",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## 展示中间件不参与身份合并\n\ninline-tokens.mjs + game-text.js\n<DT_...> 转图标；未知标记保留\n原文仍在 reference，可回查",
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
